@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

' --- Entities (Rectangles) ---
rectangle "User" as User
rectangle "Listing" as Listing
rectangle "Bid" as Bid

' --- Relationships (Use usecase ovals as labels) ---
usecase "Manages" as Manages
usecase "Places" as Places
usecase "Receives" as Receives

' --- User Attributes (Ovals) ---
usecase "id (PK)" as U_ID
usecase "name" as U_Name
usecase "email" as U_Email

' --- Listing Attributes (Ovals) ---
usecase "id (PK)" as L_ID
usecase "title" as L_Title
usecase "reservePrice" as L_ReservePrice

' --- Bid Attributes (Ovals) ---
usecase "id (PK)" as B_ID
usecase "amount" as B_Amount

' --- Connect Attributes to Entities ---
U_ID --- User
U_Name --- User
U_Email --- User

L_ID --- Listing
L_Title --- Listing
L_ReservePrice --- Listing

B_ID --- Bid
B_Amount --- Bid

' --- Connect Entities via Relationships ---
User --- Manages
Manages --- Listing

User --- Places
Places --- Bid

Listing --- Receives
Receives --- Bid

@enduml